  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A negatively charged particle is stationary halfway between two horizontal charged plates. The plates are separated by a distance d with potential difference V between them.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the magnitude of the electric field and direction of the electric field at the position of the particle?</p>\n<table><tbody><tr><td></td><td><p>Magnitude of<br/>electric field</p></td><td><p>Direction of<br/>electric field</p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"A\"><td><p>A.</p></td><td><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2V}{d}\"></span></p></td><td><p>up</p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"B\"><td><p>B.</p></td><td><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{V}{d}\"></span></p></td><td><p>up</p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"C\"><td><p>C.</p></td><td><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2V}{d}\"></span></p></td><td><p>down</p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"D\"><td><p>D.</p></td><td><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{V}{d}\"></span></p></td><td><p>down</p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>[1]</p>"
